{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"gold-and-gears","chapterId":"quest-8016103","referenceCommit":"a66ec9c36e3321ce4ea9e62b58e9326634628dce","sourceIds":["quest-8016103"],"missing":0,"orderNote":"실행 연결이 확인된 장면만 복원했습니다. 확인이 필요한 구간은 기존 참조 순서를 유지합니다.","rows":[{"id":"gold-and-gears-quest-8016103-quest-8016103-0","entryId":"gold-and-gears","chapterId":"quest-8016103","missionId":"quest-8016103","mission":"황금과 기계: 컴퍼니 비화•1","scene":"헤르타 · [개척자], 어때? 시뮬레이션 우주는 꽤 재미있지?","type":"dialogue","speaker":"헤르타","text":"[개척자], 어때? 시뮬레이션 우주는 꽤 재미있지?","talkId":403060081,"source":"Config/Level/Mission/8016103/Act/Act403060080.json","flowStatus":"verified","nextIds":["gold-and-gears-quest-8016103-quest-8016103-1"],"flowScene":"7d810a9f69b79e6b","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"cb470532b05a7b4a","bwikiNextIds":["gold-and-gears-quest-8016103-quest-8016103-1"],"bwikiPage":"黄金与机械：公司秘闻•其一","bwikiRevision":96775,"bwikiMissionId":"quest-8016103","bwikiMission":"황금과 기계: 컴퍼니 비화•1"},{"id":"gold-and-gears-quest-8016103-quest-8016103-1","entryId":"gold-and-gears","chapterId":"quest-8016103","missionId":"quest-8016103","mission":"황금과 기계: 컴퍼니 비화•1","scene":"헤르타 · [개척자], 어때? 시뮬레이션 우주는 꽤 재미있지?","type":"dialogue","speaker":"헤르타","text":"네가 탐사할 때 어떤 아이디어가 떠올라서 바로 행동으로 옮겼지. 어차피 기다릴 동안 할 것도 없었으니까, 저 꼬마 친구에게 시뮬레이션 우주에서 보고 들은 것을 공유하기로 했어","talkId":403060082,"source":"Config/Level/Mission/8016103/Act/Act403060080.json","flowStatus":"verified","nextIds":["gold-and-gears-quest-8016103-quest-8016103-2"],"flowScene":"7d810a9f69b79e6b","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"cb470532b05a7b4a","bwikiNextIds":["gold-and-gears-quest-8016103-quest-8016103-2"],"bwikiPage":"黄金与机械：公司秘闻•其一","bwikiRevision":96775,"bwikiMissionId":"quest-8016103","bwikiMission":"황금과 기계: 컴퍼니 비화•1"},{"id":"gold-and-gears-quest-8016103-quest-8016103-2","entryId":"gold-and-gears","chapterId":"quest-8016103","missionId":"quest-8016103","mission":"황금과 기계: 컴퍼니 비화•1","scene":"헤르타 · [개척자], 어때? 시뮬레이션 우주는 꽤 재미있지?","type":"dialogue","speaker":"헤르타","text":"우리는 「제왕」 루버트에 대해서 내기했어. 역사적으로 루버트는 파괴되었고, 기계제국은 멸망했지. 그가 컴퍼니의 자객 때문에 죽었다는 이야기도 있고, 「적막의 영주」에게 파괴됐다는 말도 있어","talkId":403060083,"source":"Config/Level/Mission/8016103/Act/Act403060080.json","flowStatus":"verified","nextIds":["gold-and-gears-quest-8016103-quest-8016103-3"],"flowScene":"7d810a9f69b79e6b","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"cb470532b05a7b4a","bwikiNextIds":["gold-and-gears-quest-8016103-quest-8016103-3"],"bwikiPage":"黄金与机械：公司秘闻•其一","bwikiRevision":96775,"bwikiMissionId":"quest-8016103","bwikiMission":"황금과 기계: 컴퍼니 비화•1"},{"id":"gold-and-gears-quest-8016103-quest-8016103-3","entryId":"gold-and-gears","chapterId":"quest-8016103","missionId":"quest-8016103","mission":"황금과 기계: 컴퍼니 비화•1","scene":"헤르타 · [개척자], 어때? 시뮬레이션 우주는 꽤 재미있지?","type":"dialogue","speaker":"헤르타","text":"어떤 게 사실일까? 난 폴카•카카몬드라고 생각해","talkId":403060084,"source":"Config/Level/Mission/8016103/Act/Act403060080.json","flowStatus":"verified","nextIds":["gold-and-gears-quest-8016103-quest-8016103-4"],"flowScene":"7d810a9f69b79e6b","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"cb470532b05a7b4a","bwikiNextIds":["gold-and-gears-quest-8016103-quest-8016103-4"],"bwikiPage":"黄金与机械：公司秘闻•其一","bwikiRevision":96775,"bwikiMissionId":"quest-8016103","bwikiMission":"황금과 기계: 컴퍼니 비화•1"},{"id":"gold-and-gears-quest-8016103-quest-8016103-4","entryId":"gold-and-gears","chapterId":"quest-8016103","missionId":"quest-8016103","mission":"황금과 기계: 컴퍼니 비화•1","scene":"헤르타 · [개척자], 어때? 시뮬레이션 우주는 꽤 재미있지?","type":"choice","speaker":"화자 미지정","text":"뭘 걸었나요?","talkId":403060085,"source":"Config/Level/Mission/8016103/Act/Act403060080.json","flowStatus":"verified","nextIds":["gold-and-gears-quest-8016103-quest-8016103-5"],"flowScene":"7d810a9f69b79e6b","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"cb470532b05a7b4a","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"黄金与机械：公司秘闻•其一","bwikiRevision":96775,"bwikiMissionId":"quest-8016103","bwikiMission":"황금과 기계: 컴퍼니 비화•1"},{"id":"gold-and-gears-quest-8016103-quest-8016103-5","entryId":"gold-and-gears","chapterId":"quest-8016103","missionId":"quest-8016103","mission":"황금과 기계: 컴퍼니 비화•1","scene":"헤르타 · [개척자], 어때? 시뮬레이션 우주는 꽤 재미있지?","type":"dialogue","speaker":"소형 로봇","text":"전 전자일 가능성도 있을 거로 생각해요. 컴퍼니는 「루버트 1세」와 끝까지 싸울 테니까요","talkId":403060086,"source":"Config/Level/Mission/8016103/Act/Act403060080.json","flowStatus":"verified","nextIds":["gold-and-gears-quest-8016103-quest-8016103-6"],"flowScene":"7d810a9f69b79e6b","replyToIds":["gold-and-gears-quest-8016103-quest-8016103-4"],"bwikiStatus":"review"},{"id":"gold-and-gears-quest-8016103-quest-8016103-6","entryId":"gold-and-gears","chapterId":"quest-8016103","missionId":"quest-8016103","mission":"황금과 기계: 컴퍼니 비화•1","scene":"헤르타 · [개척자], 어때? 시뮬레이션 우주는 꽤 재미있지?","type":"dialogue","speaker":"헤르타","text":"두고 봐야지. 내가 이기면 전략투자부의 이번 방문 계획을 처음부터 끝까지 전부 알려주기로 했어. 뭐, 나야 사실 별로 관심은 없지만 말이야","talkId":403060087,"source":"Config/Level/Mission/8016103/Act/Act403060080.json","flowStatus":"verified","nextIds":["gold-and-gears-quest-8016103-quest-8016103-7"],"flowScene":"7d810a9f69b79e6b","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"5462a8dea236da1e","bwikiNextIds":["gold-and-gears-quest-8016103-quest-8016103-7"],"bwikiPage":"黄金与机械：公司秘闻•其一","bwikiRevision":96775,"bwikiMissionId":"quest-8016103","bwikiMission":"황금과 기계: 컴퍼니 비화•1"},{"id":"gold-and-gears-quest-8016103-quest-8016103-7","entryId":"gold-and-gears","chapterId":"quest-8016103","missionId":"quest-8016103","mission":"황금과 기계: 컴퍼니 비화•1","scene":"헤르타 · [개척자], 어때? 시뮬레이션 우주는 꽤 재미있지?","type":"dialogue","speaker":"헤르타","text":"내가 지면 시뮬레이션 우주 소유권을 컴퍼니에 양도하기로 했어","talkId":403060088,"source":"Config/Level/Mission/8016103/Act/Act403060080.json","flowStatus":"verified","nextIds":["gold-and-gears-quest-8016103-quest-8016103-8"],"flowScene":"7d810a9f69b79e6b","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"5462a8dea236da1e","bwikiNextIds":["gold-and-gears-quest-8016103-quest-8016103-8"],"bwikiPage":"黄金与机械：公司秘闻•其一","bwikiRevision":96775,"bwikiMissionId":"quest-8016103","bwikiMission":"황금과 기계: 컴퍼니 비화•1"},{"id":"gold-and-gears-quest-8016103-quest-8016103-8","entryId":"gold-and-gears","chapterId":"quest-8016103","missionId":"quest-8016103","mission":"황금과 기계: 컴퍼니 비화•1","scene":"헤르타 · [개척자], 어때? 시뮬레이션 우주는 꽤 재미있지?","type":"dialogue","speaker":"헤르타","text":"무려 「적막의 영주」잖아. 내가 어떻게 질 수가 있겠어? 아, 이 일은 완•매와 스크루룸에게는 비밀이야","talkId":403060089,"source":"Config/Level/Mission/8016103/Act/Act403060080.json","flowStatus":"verified","nextIds":[],"flowScene":"7d810a9f69b79e6b","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"5462a8dea236da1e","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"黄金与机械：公司秘闻•其一","bwikiRevision":96775,"bwikiMissionId":"quest-8016103","bwikiMission":"황금과 기계: 컴퍼니 비화•1"}],"textReferenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","retainedTextRowIds":[],"referenceOrder":["gold-and-gears-quest-8016103-quest-8016103-0","gold-and-gears-quest-8016103-quest-8016103-1","gold-and-gears-quest-8016103-quest-8016103-2","gold-and-gears-quest-8016103-quest-8016103-3","gold-and-gears-quest-8016103-quest-8016103-4","gold-and-gears-quest-8016103-quest-8016103-5","gold-and-gears-quest-8016103-quest-8016103-6","gold-and-gears-quest-8016103-quest-8016103-7","gold-and-gears-quest-8016103-quest-8016103-8"],"flow":{"verifiedRows":9,"reviewRows":0,"verifiedScenes":1,"partialScenes":0,"reorderedScenes":0},"bwikiBaseOrder":["gold-and-gears-quest-8016103-quest-8016103-0","gold-and-gears-quest-8016103-quest-8016103-1","gold-and-gears-quest-8016103-quest-8016103-2","gold-and-gears-quest-8016103-quest-8016103-3","gold-and-gears-quest-8016103-quest-8016103-4","gold-and-gears-quest-8016103-quest-8016103-5","gold-and-gears-quest-8016103-quest-8016103-6","gold-and-gears-quest-8016103-quest-8016103-7","gold-and-gears-quest-8016103-quest-8016103-8"],"bwiki":{"matchedRows":0,"cachedRows":8,"reviewRows":1,"segments":2,"reorderedRows":0}}